_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le05ob04re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le05ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le05ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le05ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tThank you, Frank, for agreeing to train me before my first shift.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tThat is no problem at all, Jose. We've all been there before, and I know how overwhelming new environments can be.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tYes. I'm getting used to the way people behave here compared to in my country. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tOh yeah? What differences have you noticed?"}, {"time": "18200", "image": "engenn8le05ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tFor example, I found that no one really stares at you here when they speak. Where I come from, it's very common to stare at anybody.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tI see ... Well, it's something that people find very rude here. You won't obtain any favors from anyone that way, especially from our customers! It puts a strain on the relationship between the waiter and the customers.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tHow do we stain them? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\t Strain, not stain. You stain something when it becomes dirty. A strain means a great effort to do something."}, {"time": "51000", "image": "engenn8le05ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tThank you. Sometimes I need people to explain some words to me.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tThat's fine. I think you're doing great! Your English is not bad at all.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tI'm taking evening classes on my days off.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tThat's a good idea. In any case, you don't need to speak like a professor to get started. It's better to communicate in plain sentences at first. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tHopefully the customers will understand. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tAlways repeat their order to ascertain that you got it right!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tAscertain?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tIt means making sure of something.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>: \t\tThanks, Frank. You are a walking dictionary!"}]}}], "_data": [], "id": 1, "type": "audio"}]}], "type": "sena"}